{"id":"u-6adeb52d-df1e-4217-839b-ef6ed4af2247","src":"community","title":"16 Weeks to Neck Like Beast","author":"Butcher","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ewnHvG-16-weeks-to-neck-like-beast","desc":"This program exists for one reason:\nto fix the most obvious weak point in almost every physique — the neck.\n\nMost lifters build their chest, arms, and shoulders…\nand completely ignore the one area that defines presence from across the room.\n\nThis program is designed to:\n\n* Build a thick, dense, and muscular neck using proven movements like neck curls and neck extensions\n* Increase overall strength and resilience of the cervical spine\n* Create a more balanced, complete, and dominant-looking physique\n* Eliminate the “big body, small neck” look that kills visual impact\n\nHow it works:\n\n* Focused progression on neck curls and neck extensions\n* High-frequency training to maximize adaptation\n* Controlled execution — no ego lifting, no shortcuts\n* Simple, repeatable structure that drives consistent growth\n\nEnd result after 16 weeks:\n\n* A neck that visibly transforms your entire silhouette\n* Noticeably improved proportions and presence\n* A physique that looks strong from every angle — not just the mirror front view\n\n⸻\n\nReality check (and why this works)\n\nIf your neck is underdeveloped, your physique will never look complete. Period.\n\nThis program fixes that — directly, efficiently, and without fluff.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["At Home"],"minutes":10,"joins":18,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-15T00:14:47.595Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Neck Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":25,"rpe":7,"x":2},{"lo":10,"hi":25,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Neck Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":25,"rpe":7,"x":2},{"lo":10,"hi":25,"rpe":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Neck Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":25,"rpe":7,"x":2},{"lo":10,"hi":25,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Neck Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"